<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91548" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῠρά</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶν</span>, τά, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>watch-fires</i>, in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only nom. and acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καίωμεν πυρὰ πολλά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.509
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				554
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.77
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκαύσαντες π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.134
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύρ᾽ αἴθει</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν</span>) prob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυραίθει</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν</span>) in <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				41
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				78
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				823
			</span></i> (lyr.) and for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύραιθεῖν</span>
			(sic) in <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				1.13
			</span></i> P.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρὰ δαίεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					136
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς . . ᾐσθάνοντό τὰ πυρὰ
				. . φανέντα</span> the <i>beacon-fires</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.102
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. κατασβεννύναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					6.3.25
				</span></i>
			; dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτυγχάνει πυροῖς
			ἐρήμοις</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.2.18
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				4.2.16
			</span></i>; of volcanic <i>fires</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				833a1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρά . . εὔδηλα πᾶσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Scymn.
					258
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῆμος π. ἐς τὸν Τίβεριν πολλὰ
					ἐνέβαλε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					55.13
				</span></i>
			. (A sg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρόν</span> is cited by
				Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.944
			</span></i>, but rejected by <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				729.63
			</span></i>: the accent, as well as dat. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυροῖς</span>, shows that <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρά</span>
			does not belong to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ</span>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
